# Canonical artifacts and configurations are byte-exact by design. Three configuration files are
# read through a canonical-bytes validator that rejects any CR and requires a trailing LF
# (configs/modeling/default.json and both configs/policy/*.json), so a Windows checkout under the
# default core.autocrlf=true silently rewrites "}\n" to "}\r\n" and the service refuses to start.
#
# Every stored blob is already LF, so pinning the checkout is the whole fix.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.woff2 binary
*.pyd   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.ico   binary
